# A play session for the owner on R8's release (docs/NATIVE_R8.md: build/r8/rel8g -- rel8b's tree with the RPCS3
# comparison's changes, section 9.3: the precision clamp, ps3recomp 0128, and DOTHEROES_PPFX_NONNEG on, so the
# first dungeon's hero no longer sparkles;
# the native release -- no RSX command path, no SPU interpreter, the physics
# tasks issued directly, leaf promotion):
#   SCENARIO=owner_play_r8 build/venv/Scripts/python.exe tests/boot_smoke.py
# As owner_play: the validated configuration, sound, the frame-rate readout
# with its graph, normal damage, fullscreen; 144 fps synced to the owner's
# 144 Hz monitor (the owner's choice, 2026-11-07): benchmark mode's pacing --
# no game cap, a flip complete when executed (DOTHEROES_BENCH=1) -- with the
# present kept in FIFO, so VSync holds it at the display's refresh with no
# tearing (PS3RECOMP_VK_PRESENT_MODE=fifo; benchmark mode alone would present
# in mailbox, ~200 fps of which the display shows 144). The game's timers,
# movement and physics follow time (docs/NATIVE_R8.md section 3). Two settings
# that sounded right were not: DOTHEROES_FPS=0 alone still completes each flip
# on the port's 60 Hz vblank tick (60 fps), and DOTHEROES_FPS=display picks the
# fewest refreshes that keep it at or under 90 fps (72 on 144 Hz).
# Saves in build/play-route/gamedata, the session
# root seeded from a copy of the owner's save (the owner's own saves are not
# touched; progress from earlier sessions continues). Records frames.log,
# record.log, hitches (F8, or L3+R3) and a copy of the save each time the game
# saves. Close the window when done. DOTHEROES_PPFX_NONNEG=1 is on here only
# (not yet run outside the first dungeon): if a scene looks wrong, the session
# can be started with DOTHEROES_PPFX_NONNEG=0 in the environment to compare.
#! env BIN=build/r8/rel8g/dotheroes.exe GAMEDATA=build/play-route/gamedata RUNS_IN=build/sessions KEEP_RUNS=1000 PREEMPT_TESTS=1
#! env DOTHEROES_PPFX_NATIVE=1 DOTHEROES_NATIVE_CD=1 DOTHEROES_NATIVE_SOLVER=4,5,6 GCM_WRAP_LAP=1 DOTHEROES_PRESENT_ONCE=1
#! env DOTHEROES_BENCH=1 PS3RECOMP_VK_PRESENT_MODE=fifo DOTHEROES_FPS=0 DOTHEROES_DEV_CANT_DIE=0
#! env DOTHEROES_PPFX_NONNEG=1
#! env WINDOW=1 PS3RECOMP_VK_FULLSCREEN=1 AUDIO=1 PS3_OSD_FPS=2 DUMP=0 SHOT_EVERY=0 PS3_VERBOSE=0
#! env DOTHEROES_DEV_KEYS=1 DOTHEROES_DEV_STATE=1 DOTHEROES_DEV_RECORD=1 DIAG_FRAMES=frames.log
#! env PS3_FTRACE_ROLL=hitch PS3_FTRACE_ROLL_FROM=60 DOTHEROES_PHYS_STATS=1
#! env PS3RECOMP_SPIRV_CACHE=build/play-route/cache
#! secs 14400
until_exit ${SAVE_COPIES:-build/checkpoints/owner-play-r8}
